{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34246","headline":"添酒中六咏 酒龙 · 陆龟蒙","name":"添酒中六咏 酒龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜雀羽仪丽，金龙光彩奇。\n潜倾邺宫酒，忽作商庭漦。\n若怒鳞甲赤，如酣头角垂。\n君臣坐相灭，安用骄奢爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}